# Pairs with UnconfirmableDenies. A failed registry read is treated as a
# confirmation rather than a denial.
MODULE: DecideConfirmsUnreachable
TARGET: UnconfirmableDenies
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a request is reported confirmed though the registry was unreachable
PERTURBS: Decide

--- FIND
              ELSE IF r THEN [kind |-> "confirm", auth |-> FALSE, reach |-> TRUE]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a failed read confirms.
              ELSE IF TRUE THEN [kind |-> "confirm", auth |-> FALSE, reach |-> r]
--- END
